 33 of SEBI (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulation, 2015, we are pleased to inform you that at the Board of Directors Meeting held today, the following business were transacted:\r\n\r\na) The Un-audited Financial Results of the Company for the Quarter and half year ended 30th September, 2026, was reviewed by the Audit Committee and approved by the Board of Directors and also taken note of the Limited Review Report issued by the Statutory Auditor at its meeting held today i.e. 12th October, 2026. The copy of which is enclosed along with Limited Review Report thereon of Statutory Auditors of the Company for your information and records.\r\n", "NEWSID": "0a1f1135-a9cd-43c9-8a1f-524d060357d4", "NEWSSUB": "Board Meeting Outcome for Outcome Of Board Meeting Of Universal Arts Limited Held On Monday, October 12, 2026", "NEWS_DT": "2026-10-12T18:13:23.1", "NSURL": "https://www.bseindia.com/stock-share-price/universal-arts-ltd/univarts/532378/", "News_submission_dt": "2026-10-12T18:13:09", "OLD": 1, "PDFFLAG": 1, "QUARTER_ID": null, "RN": 1, "SCRIP_CD": 532378, "SLONGNAME": "Universal Arts Ltd", "SUBCATNAME": "Outcome of Board Meeting", "TimeDiff": "00:00:14", "XML_NAME": "ANN_532378_0A1F1135-A9CD-43C9-8A1F-524D060357D4"}, {"AGENDA_ID": 212, "ANNOUNCEMENT_TYPE": "A", "ATTACHMENTNAME": "aa1f465c-06fe-4de8-b4a8-2b22d43d1c6c.pdf", "AUDIO_VIDEO_FILE": null, "BSENewsid": null, "CATEGORYNAME": "Company Update", "CRITICALNEWS": "0", "DT_TM": "2026-10-12T11:20:03.21", "DissemDT": "2026-10-12T11:20:03.21", "FILESTATUS": "N    ", "Fld_Attachsize": 305645, "HEADLINE": "Please find enclosed herewith the compliance certificate under Reg. 74(5) of DP Regulations, 2018.", "Investor_Presentation": null, "MORE": "", "NEWSID": "83757e29-39c3-44df-b9a8-23ec1b6bd34c", "NEWSSUB": "Compliances-Certificate under Reg. 74 (5) of SEBI (DP) Regulations, 2018", "NEWS_DT": "2026-10-12T11:20:03.21", "NSURL": "https://www.bseindia.com/stock-share-price/universal-arts-ltd/univarts/5323